        </div>

        <div class="use-cases">
          <span class="use-case"><span class="icon">&#x1F9EA;</span> Mock / Test Doubles</span>
          <span class="use-case"><span class="icon">&#x2699;&#xFE0F;</span> Config Placeholders</span>
          <span class="use-case"><span class="icon">&#x1F517;</span> Fluent API Stubs</span>
          <span class="use-case"><span class="icon">&#x1F6E1;&#xFE0F;</span> Null Object Pattern</span>
        </div>
        <div class="trick-divider"></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Trick 2: lru_cache -->
    <article class="trick">
      <div class="trick-header">
        <div class="trick-number">02</div>
        <div class="trick-title-group">
          <h2 class="trick-title">functools.lru_cache</h2>
          <p class="trick-subtitle">Memoization with Zero Boilerplate</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trick-body">
        <p class="trick-desc">
          为纯函数结果做缓存，避免重复计算。<code>maxsize</code> 控制缓存大小，<code>typed=True</code> 区分不同类型的同值参数。一行装饰器，性能飞升。
        </p>

        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-block-header">
            <div class="code-block-dots">
              <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <span class="code-block-label">fibonacci.py</span>
          </div>
          <pre set:html={codeLruCache}></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <span class="step-num">1</span>
            <span class="step-text">首次调用 <code>fib(n)</code> 时正常递归计算，并将参数与结果存入缓存</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="step-num">2</span>
            <span class="step-text">后续调用相同参数时直接返回缓存结果，跳过递归</span>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="step-num">3</span>
            <span class="step-text"><code>maxsize=128</code> 限制最多缓存 128 个不同参数的结果，LRU 策略淘汰</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="callout">
          <p><strong>fib(6)</strong> 实际只递归计算一次。后续所有调用直接命中缓存，时间复杂度从 O(2^n) 降至 O(n)。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="trick-divider"></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Trick 3: singledispatch -->
    <article class="trick">
      <div class="trick-header">
        <div class="trick-number">03</div>
        <div class="trick-title-group">
          <h2 class="trick-title">functools.singledispatch</h2>
          <p class="trick-subtitle">Type-Based Function Overloading</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trick-body">
        <p class="trick-desc">
          基于"第一个参数类型"分派到对应实现。可在任意模块延后注册新类型的处理逻辑，无需修改原函数。Python 版的函数重载。
        </p>

        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-block-header">
            <div class="code-block-dots">
              <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <span class="code-block-label">dispatch.py</span>
          </div>
          <pre set:html={codeSingledispatch}></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="mechanism">
          <div class="mechanism-item">
            <div class="label">Default</div>
            <code>to_str(x)</code>
            <p class="desc">未注册类型走 fallback</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mechanism-item">
            <div class="label">Registered</div>
            <code>@to_str.register</code>
            <p class="desc">按类型注解自动分派</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="callout">
          <p>比 <code>if isinstance(x, int)</code> 链更清晰、更可扩展。第三方库可在不动原函数的前提下注册新类型。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="trick-divider"></div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Trick 4: globals() RPC -->
    <article class="trick">
      <div class="trick-header">
        <div class="trick-number">04</div>
        <div class="trick-title-group">
          <h2 class="trick-title">globals() C/S RPC</h2>
